# Implementation Plan: Scam SMS Sandbox Backend & Fullstack Integration

This plan outlines the architecture and implementation of the complete backend for the Scam SMS Sandbox application, featuring threat heuristics, native SQLite / Prisma state storage, Bhashini multi-lingual advisories, and live frontend integration.

---

## 1. Architecture Overview

```
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|                      React Frontend                         |
|  - ScannerPage: SMS / URL Form -> POST /api/scan            |
|  - Threat Verdict & Bhashini Multi-Lingual Advisory Card   |
|  - 1-Click "Report to 1930 / I4C" -> POST /api/reports/:id  |
|  - DashboardPage: Live I4C Telemetry & Citizen Table        |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
                               |
                               | (HTTP / Fetch API)
                               v
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|                 Backend API Layer (Express / Vite)          |
|  - POST /api/scan: Regex extraction & Threat Engine         |
|  - GET /api/reports: Fetch recent scanned threat dossiers   |
|  - POST /api/reports/:id/report-i4c: Mark reported to I4C   |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
                               |
                               v
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|               Threat Logic Engine & Heuristics              |
|  - Rule A: Bill cutoffs + phone / short link -> 95 (DANGER) |
|  - Rule B: .apk or "download update/YONO" -> 98 (DANGER)    |
|  - Rule C: Bank OTP layout -> 5 (SAFE)                      |
|  - Rule D: Fallback heuristic -> 60 (SUSPICIOUS)            |
|  - Bhashini generator: en, hi, ta, te, mr, bn advisories    |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
                               |
                               v
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|              Database & State Storage (SQLite)              |
|  - Native `node:sqlite` DB (`server/scam_sandbox.db`)       |
|  - Seeded initial incidents + persistent runtime storage    |
|  - Prisma Schema (`prisma/schema.prisma`) definition        |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
```

