## 2. Proposed Changes

### Database & Models

#### [NEW] [schema.prisma](file:///c:/Users/Haree/OneDrive/Desktop/hck.1/prisma/schema.prisma)
- Define standard Prisma schema for `ScamReport`:
  - `id`: String (UUID / cuid)
  - `rawMessage`: String
  - `senderIdentifier`: String?
  - `extractedUrl`: String?
  - `domainAgeDays`: Int?
  - `riskScore`: Int
  - `riskLevel`: String ("SAFE" | "SUSPICIOUS" | "DANGER")
  - `riskCategory`: String ("ELECTRICITY_DISCOM" | "BANK_KYC" | "LOTTERY" | "APK_MALWARE" | "LEGIT")
  - `localizedSummary`: Json / String (en, hi, ta, te, mr, bn)
  - `screenshotUrl`: String?
  - `reportedToI4C`: Boolean @default(false)
  - `createdAt`: DateTime @default(now())

#### [NEW] [db.js](file:///c:/Users/Haree/OneDrive/Desktop/hck.1/server/db.js)
- Native SQLite database using Node 24's built-in `node:sqlite` (`DatabaseSync`).
- Creates table `scam_reports` if not exists, indexed on `createdAt`.
- Helper methods:
  - `createReport(reportData)`
  - `getReports(limit, filter)`
  - `getReportById(id)`
  - `markReportedToI4C(id)`
- Pre-seeds with initial high-fidelity Indian scam scenarios (BESCOM bill, SBI YONO, India Post, legit HDFC OTP) so the I4C admin dashboard is populated immediately.

